{
  "_comment": [
    "Chapter 10 obstacle list -- input to map_clean.py.",
    "Position is the tile the model stands on, 1-based. Clear lists the tile",
    "rectangles the painted art covers where that is not the model's own tile.",
    "",
    "Generated from the tile matrix: every 31 is the low fire bowl (fire_pillar_1),",
    "every 69 the bright column (fire_pillar_2) and every 68 the dim column",
    "(fire_pillar_3). A column is painted over two rows -- its flame (56 over 69,",
    "52 over 68) on the row above -- and stands on the lower one, so Clear takes",
    "both rows. Every 56/52 in the matrix has its 69/68 directly under it."
  ],
